# Frontend
#
# `*.png` above exists for sweep plots, but it matches every frontend image too --
# a favicon or a logo would be dropped silently and only show up as a broken build on a
# fresh clone. These negations undo that for the two directories images live in; they
# work because only a file pattern was excluded above, never a parent directory.
!frontend/public/**/*.png
!frontend/src/assets/**/*.png

frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

# Browser-automation scratch output from visual checks.
.playwright-mcp/

# The built bundle. Committing minified JS would put unreviewable diffs in the history of
# a repository whose whole convention is explained changes, so it is built on demand:
# `qecgen ui` names the command when it is missing.
#
# The whole directory, with no `.gitkeep` exception: Vite builds with `emptyOutDir`, which
# wipes anything placed here to hold the directory open. A fresh clone therefore has no
# `static/` at all, which `create_app` handles -- it serves the build instructions and
# leaves the API running.
qecgen/ui/static/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
